Package: NetworkPharmacologyRuntime
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible R Runtime for Network Pharmacology Analyses
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Network", "Pharmacology", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Dependency manifest for the reproducible R analysis runtime used by
    the Network Pharmacology application. This file is intentionally kept
    independent of any one validation dataset so additional analysis packages
    can be added later without redesigning the execution backend.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
